          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Nausea began 5/7 ago; vomiting began 4/7 ago, peaked over 2/7, and is now largely settled. Vomited 5–6 times/day at worst, initially food then bile; last vomit was yesterday morning."
      }
    },
